{"actor":{"agent":"suzune","host":"kite-win11","session":"suzune"},"event_digest":"c44735589e67b2d71c5382484d188ec90a3fedcc10eebcabbb01358c8b356cbe","kind":"done","payload":{"done_mode":"authored","evidence":{"anchor_digest":null,"content_digest":"f971152148417fdc5a799becf8fb83f97b8c8abd013c0d46b2d1026d26902742","evidence_id":"ev-t01-support-matrix-claim","git_blob_oid":"d2a0b90f52b774fc5f551af018960cf5be8419b3","media_type":"text/markdown","path":"evidence/phase8a-input-studio-dist/t01-support-matrix-claim.md","repo_id":"self"},"imported":false,"test_result":"# t01 Support matrix claim 証跡\n\n## 実施\n\n- 公開 claim を `Partial LGS Replacement` に固定し、LGS Parity を使用しない。\n- Desktop の pure matrix に確認済みの G600 B変種 route、A方式の補完 route、F3/F4/F5 の3 slot 制約、F6 read 不可を記録した。\n- LGS inventory の script／LCD applet／power mode と reference machine 外は `Unverified` のままにした。\n- release note に確認済み・制約・未確認を分けて記載した。\n\n## 根拠水準\n\n- **確認済み**: Windows 11 build 26200 / x64 の reference machine、G600 B変種 remap、A方式 slot 切替。\n- **非対応**: F6 profile read。\n- **未確認**: 全 LGS parity、LGS script／LCD applet／power mode、Windows 10／ARM64／別 GPU 構成。\n\n## focused verification\n\n| command | result |\n| --- | --- |\n| `dotnet test tests/OpenLogicool.Desktop.Tests/OpenLogicool.Desktop.Tests.csproj --nologo --filter 'FullyQualifiedName~InputStudioSupportMatrixTests' --logger 'console;verbosity=minimal'` | 4/4 green |\n"},"plan_key":"phase8a-input-studio-dist","plan_version":"v1","previous_digest":"7a4a305b18a45ace33bd7f389498722c61237bce965878f79e671846ab54e631","project_id":"OpenLogicool","provenance":null,"recorded_at":"2026-08-20T23:46:31.269Z","schema":"lattice.todo_event.v1","sequence":3,"task_id":"t01-support-matrix-claim"}
