{"actor":{"agent":"suzune","host":"kite-win11","session":"suzune"},"event_digest":"83024f736d8a6e89dab60dfd3b7b077665d0e6ada305d6f3be823fd9b0882ed2","kind":"done","payload":{"done_mode":"authored","evidence":{"anchor_digest":null,"content_digest":"8118f341729a76d225e3d766ea2ad6b89822949d2a2feb81dbb7e470b9dc66eb","evidence_id":"ev-t03-timed-macro","git_blob_oid":"3844c618826ba55ee06dd6a40d787df9b0a7b90a","media_type":"text/markdown","path":"evidence/phase8a-input-studio-dist/t03-timed-macro.md","repo_id":"self"},"imported":false,"test_result":"# t03 Timed macro 証跡\n\n## 実施\n\n- delay、repeat while held、toggle、有限回 repeat を `TimedMacroState` の明示状態にした。\n- emission は一回で完結する tap action とし、保持 output を作らない。\n- `Stop()` 後に新しい action を返さず、`Resume()` 後だけ次の physical activation を許可する。\n- profile 適用前 validator で timed macro と通常 output の同一 control/layer 混在を拒否した。\n- 既存の有限 `Tap:` sequence を timed macro の outputs に混ぜず、再実装しない。\n\n## focused verification\n\n| command | result |\n| --- | --- |\n| `dotnet test tests/OpenLogicool.Input.Tests/OpenLogicool.Input.Tests.csproj --nologo --filter 'FullyQualifiedName~TimedMacroTests' --logger 'console;verbosity=minimal'` | 6/6 green |\n"},"plan_key":"phase8a-input-studio-dist","plan_version":"v1","previous_digest":"26465e0402534373b8ff0b0a3a7aceea79812faab1d82f4e515f3b43993c0b94","project_id":"OpenLogicool","provenance":null,"recorded_at":"2026-08-20T23:52:24.621Z","schema":"lattice.todo_event.v1","sequence":7,"task_id":"t03-timed-macro"}
{"actor":{"agent":"suzune","host":"kite-win11","session":"suzune"},"event_digest":"b9d3a6a6d606862e0a096adba9b09f6d01545967606abab05432d1534552ac08","kind":"done","payload":{"done_mode":"authored","evidence":{"anchor_digest":null,"content_digest":"7e55b48c53fd32b47e8342cddfa91eaba977facf3da30560acf5792b3a6a33d9","evidence_id":"ev-t05-diagnostic-bundle","git_blob_oid":"3d44c2d25a82969a5f9438f5deb0ee670f620b9b","media_type":"text/markdown","path":"evidence/phase8a-input-studio-dist/t05-diagnostic-bundle.md","repo_id":"self"},"imported":false,"test_result":"# t05 Diagnostic bundle\n\n## 実装\n\n- `DiagnosticBundle` を追加した。preview は filesystem に書かず、既定 bundle の固定 manifest を返す。\n- create は preview 済み manifest 1件だけをローカルへ書き、delete はその bundle 1件だけを削除する。\n- 既存 `diagnostics` CLI の device／DB／profile／identity 収集は再実装しない。既定 bundle は screen、OCR、prompt、journal 本文、crash dump、secret、個人データを探索・収集・保存しない。\n\n## 検証\n\n`dotnet test tests/OpenLogicool.Host.Tests/OpenLogicool.Host.Tests.csproj --no-restore --filter FullyQualifiedName~DiagnosticBundleTests --logger console;verbosity=normal`\n\n- 2 tests passed / exit 0\n- preview が未書込みで固定 manifest だけを示すことを確認した。\n- create の内容が preview と一致し、delete 後にその bundle だけが消えることを確認した。\n"},"plan_key":"phase8a-input-studio-dist","plan_version":"v1","previous_digest":"83024f736d8a6e89dab60dfd3b7b077665d0e6ada305d6f3be823fd9b0882ed2","project_id":"OpenLogicool","provenance":null,"recorded_at":"2026-08-20T23:56:24.121Z","schema":"lattice.todo_event.v1","sequence":8,"task_id":"t05-diagnostic-bundle"}
