{"actor":{"agent":"suzune","host":"kite-win11","session":"suzune"},"event_digest":"a805cfb526e1fca6da7aaad4a359808b77bac2f76b28026c33a886a17eba4f26","kind":"done","payload":{"done_mode":"authored","evidence":{"anchor_digest":null,"content_digest":"f3285c9990ac93b9d2116a4996b579efd48ebb9d1a597d88062b1e4af6be1eb8","evidence_id":"ev-t04-lgs-restore-rollback","git_blob_oid":"2b701db44740a58849df2665bbb2ee5207d07862","media_type":"text/markdown","path":"evidence/phase8a-input-studio-dist/t04-lgs-restore-rollback.md","repo_id":"self"},"imported":false,"test_result":"# t04 LGS restore / rollback 証跡\n\n## 実施\n\n- `CancelDryRun` は LGS XML dry-run の convertible／unsupported 数を返し、apply を開始しない。\n- cancel 結果は元 LGS profile が保持されたことを明示する。\n- `RestoreG600Baseline` は既存 `G600LeftoverSession.Restore()` にのみ委譲し、G600 write/readback/retry を再実装しない。\n- restore の device 不在・共存ソフト・baseline 不在・hard failure を `G600BaselineRestored` と表示しない。\n\n## focused verification\n\n| command | result |\n| --- | --- |\n| `dotnet test tests/OpenLogicool.Host.Tests/OpenLogicool.Host.Tests.csproj --nologo --filter 'FullyQualifiedName~MigrationRollbackTests' --logger 'console;verbosity=minimal'` | 3/3 green |\n"},"plan_key":"phase8a-input-studio-dist","plan_version":"v1","previous_digest":"538052e5e3cc5c277448ce8c715c27e1516c2492c4ce766639b450333aa2f914","project_id":"OpenLogicool","provenance":null,"recorded_at":"2026-08-21T00:01:36.683Z","schema":"lattice.todo_event.v1","sequence":11,"task_id":"t04-lgs-restore-rollback"}
{"actor":{"agent":"suzune","host":"kite-win11","session":"suzune"},"event_digest":"96535370450aa6c4c12034fa8836dafcf19f3a58b51a89c8ef0d7cade7388560","kind":"done","payload":{"done_mode":"authored","evidence":{"anchor_digest":null,"content_digest":"a626e55087789ea7a8a4ef255e4497311bcf92fca2ec42bba1dac637c905e876","evidence_id":"ev-t06-packaging-identity","git_blob_oid":"7a9b8e501c1c4d50f211a7288a7bd8073db46a8b","media_type":"text/markdown","path":"evidence/phase8a-input-studio-dist/t06-packaging-identity.md","repo_id":"self"},"imported":false,"test_result":"# t06 Package identity と配布 layout\n\n## 実装\n\n- unpackaged 開発配布の identity と layout を `OpenLogicool.Packaging` に定義した。\n- Host と Watchdog を同じ application 配下の必須ファイルとして示す。\n- MSIX／Sparse Package／MSI、autostart、update manifest は EXP-DIST-01 の clean VM 実測前のため、未決定・未確認として固定した。\n- install/update が device write を開始しないことを contract にした。\n\n## 検証\n\n`dotnet test tests/OpenLogicool.Packaging.Tests/OpenLogicool.Packaging.Tests.csproj --no-restore --filter FullyQualifiedName~PackageIdentityTests --logger console;verbosity=normal`\n\n- 2 tests passed / exit 0\n- unpackaged layout が公開方式の採択を名乗らないこと、autostart/update が未確認であること、device write を開始しないことを確認した。\n"},"plan_key":"phase8a-input-studio-dist","plan_version":"v1","previous_digest":"a805cfb526e1fca6da7aaad4a359808b77bac2f76b28026c33a886a17eba4f26","project_id":"OpenLogicool","provenance":null,"recorded_at":"2026-08-21T00:01:48.193Z","schema":"lattice.todo_event.v1","sequence":12,"task_id":"t06-packaging-identity"}
